    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WitchGhost is a challenging top down shooter with roguelike elements. Set in a haunted world, battle as Ezme the WitchGhost against waves of relentless enemies. Cast a wide array of spells and cause chaos! How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/40fb2c3f4dc18f8f55eb35020f5db5bf.webp?t=1753297498\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand crafted locations full of wonder and danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/4598121565d96368a3e239b1d9102da2.webp?t=1753297498\" width=361 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast over 50 spells to ensure your survival against the endless waves of the undead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/d48e5b732e84681d3a5d609414f40d9d.webp?t=1753297498\" width=351 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is a dangerous place, full of merciless undead and lots...and lots of explosions</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WitchGhost is a challenging top down shooter with roguelike elements. Set in a haunted world, battle as Ezme the WitchGhost against waves of relentless enemies. Cast a wide array of spells and cause chaos! How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/40fb2c3f4dc18f8f55eb35020f5db5bf.webp?t=1753297498\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand crafted locations full of wonder and danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/4598121565d96368a3e239b1d9102da2.webp?t=1753297498\" width=361 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast over 50 spells to ensure your survival against the endless waves of the undead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/d48e5b732e84681d3a5d609414f40d9d.webp?t=1753297498\" width=351 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is a dangerous place, full of merciless undead and lots...and lots of explosions</p>",
